.SS godot\-cli catalog
Project component catalog
.PP
Create, scan, list, show, validate, search, and export catalog
manifests describing project components for LLM agents.
.SS godot\-cli catalog add
Create or update a JSON catalog manifest for a scene
.PP
Writes <scene>.manifest.json beside the scene, filling scene_uid
from the scene header and scaffolding a row for each signal
declared by the root script. With \-\-update, prose already
written is preserved.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-root\fR \fIpath\fR
Godot project root (directory containing project.godot)
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR \fIvalue\fR
Catalog id (default: scene path without res:// and extension)
.TP
\fB\-\-summary\fR \fIvalue\fR
One\-line description of the component
.TP
\fB\-\-when\-to\-use\fR \fIvalue\fR
When an agent should reach for this component
.TP
\fB\-\-when\-not\-to\-use\fR \fIvalue\fR
When an agent should use something else
.TP
\fB\-\-notes\fR \fIvalue\fR
Edge cases and variant notes
.TP
\fB\-\-tags\fR \fIvalue\fR
Comma\-separated tags
.TP
\fB\-\-related\-ids\fR \fIvalue\fR
Comma\-separated related catalog ids
.TP
\fB\-\-update\fR
Update an existing manifest, keeping prose already written
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
Manifest path (default: <scene>.manifest.json beside the scene)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Render the manifest without writing it
.SS godot\-cli catalog relink
Repoint manifests whose scene has moved
.PP
For every manifest whose scene file is missing, resolves its
scene_uid through .godot/uid_cache.bin and rewrites the scene
path. Requires the project to have been opened in Godot since
the move, since the editor is what refreshes that cache. Exits
1 if any manifest is still unrepaired.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-root\fR \fIpath\fR
Godot project root (directory containing project.godot)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Report which manifests would be repointed without writing them
.SS godot\-cli catalog scan
Scan project for catalog manifests
.PP
Walks the project for *.manifest.json, parses fields, and validates
catalog entries.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-root\fR \fIpath\fR
Godot project root (directory containing project.godot)
.SS godot\-cli catalog list
