.SS godot\-cli reference
Print the command reference as Markdown or JSON
.PP
\-\-format markdown (default) prints the document committed
as
docs/commands.md. \-\-format json prints the whole command
surface —
every command, option, and value kind — for tools that wrap
the CLI.
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
